NOTE ON THE CORPUS. This licence covers the code, the annotations and the
derived results in this repository. It does NOT cover the source videos, which
were published by third parties under the YouTube Standard License and convey
no redistribution rights. No video frames are included here. The corpus is
distributed in pointer-plus-annotation form: corpus/sites.csv carries each
sequence's source URL, licence note and extraction parameters, and
corpus/manifest.csv carries a SHA-256 for every frame, so a reader who
re-extracts from the originals can verify they hold the same pixels that were
scored. Anyone re-extracting those frames is bound by the terms of the original
videos, not by this licence.
